            <ArticleTitle>Internal fixation of severely displaced mandibular condylar neck fracture with the aid of ramus osteotomy. A revised technique.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>272-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A technique is described whereby the mandibular condyle can be located, replaced and fixed in case of a severely displaced fracture with exarticulation of the condylar head.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
